{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3c2a1e-5b7d-4c9e-a1f2-3d4e5f6a7b8c",
    "name": "Huellitas Perdidas · Microservicios",
    "description": "Endpoints del sistema veterinario en microservicios.\n\n**Requisito:** todo el sistema levantado en orden: config-server → eureka-server → ms-duenio, ms-mascota, ms-veterinario, ms-turno → api-gateway (y esperar ~30 s a que se registren en Eureka).\n\n**Todas las llamadas de negocio pasan por el API Gateway** (`{{gateway}}` = http://localhost:8080). La carpeta *Infraestructura* consulta directo a Eureka, Config Server y Actuator.\n\n**Uso:** se puede ejecutar completa con el *Collection Runner*: las carpetas están en orden (crear → consultar → actualizar → errores → limpiar). Los IDs creados se guardan en variables de la colección y el DNI, email, matrícula y fecha del turno se generan al azar en cada corrida para no chocar con datos existentes. Cada request tiene un test que valida el código HTTP esperado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "gateway", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "eureka", "value": "http://localhost:8761" },
    { "key": "configServer", "value": "http://localhost:8888" },
    { "key": "msTurno", "value": "http://localhost:8084" },
    { "key": "duenioId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "mascotaId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "veterinarioId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "turnoId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "turnoSuperposicionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cedula", "value": "" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "" },
    { "key": "matricula", "value": "" },
    { "key": "fechaTurno", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Dueños (ms-duenio)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear dueño",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
                "// DNI y email únicos en cada corrida (ms-duenio no permite duplicados)",
                "const n = Math.floor(Math.random() * 90000000) + 10000000;",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cedula\", String(n));",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"email\", `juan.${n}@mail.com`);"
              ] }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
                "pm.test(\"201 Created\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"duenioId\", pm.response.json().id);"
              ] }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Perez\",\n  \"cedula\": \"{{cedula}}\",\n  \"telefono\": \"+54 11 1234-5678\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{gateway}}/api/duenios", "host": ["{{gateway}}"], "path": ["api", "duenios"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar dueños",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test(\"Devuelve una lista\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an(\"array\"));"
          ] } }],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{gateway}}/api/duenios", "host": ["{{gateway}}"], "path": ["api", "duenios"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar dueño por ID",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test(\"Es el dueño creado\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"duenioId\"))));"
          ] } }],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{gateway}}/api/duenios/{{duenioId}}", "host": ["{{gateway}}"], "path": ["api", "duenios", "{{duenioId}}"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar dueño por cédula/DNI",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test(\"Coincide la cédula\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().cedula).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"cedula\")));"
          ] } }],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{gateway}}/api/duenios/cedula/{{cedula}}", "host": ["{{gateway}}"], "path": ["api", "duenios", "cedula", "{{cedula}}"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar dueño por email",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
          ] } }],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{gateway}}/api/duenios/email/{{email}}", "host": ["{{gateway}}"], "path": ["api", "duenios", "email", "{{email}}"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar dueños por nombre y apellido",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test(\"Incluye al dueño creado\", () => {",
            "  const id = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"duenioId\"));",
            "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().map(d => d.id)).to.include(id);",
            "});"
          ] } }],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": { "raw": "{{gateway}}/api/duenios/search?nombre=Juan&apellido=Perez", "host": ["{{gateway}}"], "path": ["api", "duenios", "search"], "query": [{ "key": "nombre", "value": "Juan" }, { "key": "apellido", "value": "Perez" }] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar dueño",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "pm.test(\"Teléfono actualizado\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().telefono).to.eql(\"1144445555\"));"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Perez\",\n  \"cedula\": \"{{cedula}}\",\n  \"telefono\": \"1144445555\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{gateway}}/api/duenios/{{duenioId}}", "host": ["{{gateway}}"], "path": ["api", "duenios", "{{duenioId}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
